    "content": "# Write a python program that prints the minimum and maximum of 5 numbers enterred by the user without using built in function\n\n# Initialize variables for min and max\nmin_number = float('inf')  # set to positive infinity initially\nmax_number = float('-inf')  # set to negative infinity initially\n\n# Input five numbers from the user\nfor i in range(5):\n    number = float(input(f\"Enter number {i + 1}: \"))\n\n    # Update min and max values\n    if number < min_number:\n        min_number = number\n    if number > max_number:\n        max_number = number\n\n# Print the results\nprint(f\"The minimum number is: {min_number}\")\nprint(f\"The maximum number is: {max_number}\")\n\n\n\n"
